id: super-saiyan-3-limitless
name: Limitless
order: 1
slot: trait
description: >
  Your energy has surpassed all reason and restraint, straining your body to the limit.
text: >
  Limitless: Your energy has surpassed all reason and restraint, straining your body to the limit.
  (1)-[Passive]: All of your Attacking Maneuvers gain the Full Wager Advantage.
  (2)-[Passive]: Increase the Wound Roll of any Attacking Maneuver you make with a Ki Wager by 1/2 of the amount of Ki Points spent on the Ki Wager.
  (3)-[Passive]: Halve the Ki Points you regain through Ki Surges and Combat Recovery.
  (4)-[Passive]: While you are in the Raging or Superior State, increase your Wound Rolls and Soak Value by 1(T).
  (5)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If you hit an Opponent with an Attacking Maneuver that has a Ki Wager equal to or exceeding 1/4 of your Max Capacity, apply an Energy Charge to that Attacking Maneuver.

---

